  Hypothesis HB : ltac2:(zQ "70!h9!p5!lq4!jjb!ls9!ms5!mk6@3$3$0?1B@2$1@2$1?2sb@2$2$4@2$6+2+i0@2$2@3$5$0Z?6chunks+h0").
